  "changes": [
    "Planar three-dimensional aluminium frame extrusions, asymmetric sash lights and solid sloped projecting sills.",
    "Separate semitransparent glass, recessed shading backing and varied roller blinds; no accessible interior is claimed.",
    "225 x 75 mm water-struck brick coursing with warped mortar edges, normal relief and an independent roughness map.",
    "North stair lower window sequence follows rising flights; source main envelope and base elevation retained.",
    "Moon Garden light scoops have bell profiles, stems, flashing bases and full-detail guards.",
    "Roof weathering and lap seams; unsupported repetitive rooftop room windows replaced with limited service vents.",
    "North entry brick court clipped exactly to existing terrain triangles, with the separate central tree island and oblique Amherst street edge.",
    "Measured retaining-wall centerline rebuilt as brick with a cap; unequal raised planting beds retain ground/wall collision roles.",
    "Four solid 150 mm risers, top landing and aligned door/canopy elevation above the actual campus terrain."
  ],
  "lodPolicy": {
    "full": "Complete outer frame extrusions, highlight lips, gasket strips, sill end caps and rooflight guards. North entrance court, soil, retaining walls and continuous steps are fully present.",
    "mobile": "Preserves silhouette, recess, glazing, blind depth, frame inner return and sloped sill; omits narrow highlight lips, gaskets, sill ends and rooflight guards. Same north court ground and wall geometry; only narrow stair nosing detail is omitted."
  },
  "exportOptimization": "Only unit normals are quantized to aligned normalized signed bytes using KHR_mesh_quantization; positions, UVs and collision geometry are preserved.",
  "knownGaps": [
    "Individual room window positions and some north-brick opening groups remain photograph-informed approximations, not an exact facade survey.",
    "Terracotta tile joints and limestone surface aging are not yet individually resolved.",
    "Glass uses PBR alpha blending with a shallow shading backing; the runtime environment must supply reflections and lighting, and full physical transmission is not modeled.",
    "North entrance appendage retains the survey volume; detailed as-built lobby footprint remains uncertain.",
    "Trees and shrubs are supplied by the integrated scene. Street-side court and planted-island boundaries are orthophoto estimates; original building and measured wall centerlines are retained. Game-level contact and lighting still require integrated review."
  ],
